<Legal
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with TradeCommand on the web and on iPhone and iPad."
  updated="27 September 2026"
>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:hello@tradecommand.com.au">hello@tradecommand.com.au</a> and a person on
    our team will reply within one business day. Tell us the email address on your account and, if
    something is not working, what you tapped and what you saw.
  </p>

  <h2>Signing in</h2>
  <p>
    The TradeCommand app for iPhone and iPad signs in to the same account you use at
    <a href="https://app.tradecommand.com.au">app.tradecommand.com.au</a>. If you have forgotten your
    password, choose <strong>Forgot password</strong> on the sign-in screen and we will email you a
    reset link.
  </p>
  <p>
    Accounts are created on the web. The owner of a trade business signs up at
    app.tradecommand.com.au, then invites staff, who accept the invitation by email.
  </p>

  <h2>Notifications</h2>
  <p>
    The app asks to send notifications the first time you sign in. If you declined, turn them on in
    the iOS Settings app under <strong>Notifications &gt; TradeCommand</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>Camera and location</h2>
  <p>
    The app uses the camera only when you take a photo to attach to a job. It reads your location
    only when you clock in or out, so the business has a record of where the time was logged. You
    can change either permission in the iOS Settings app under <strong>TradeCommand</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>Deleting your account</h2>
  <p>
    In the app or on the web, open your profile and choose <strong>Delete account</strong>. If you
    are the only owner of a business, deleting your account also deletes that business and its
    records. See the <a href="/data-deletion">data deletion page</a> for the details.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for what we collect and why, or email
    <a href="mailto:privacy@tradecommand.com.au">privacy@tradecommand.com.au</a> with a privacy
    question.
  </p>
</Legal>
